  offerDialogue:
    name: Brooks
    sentences:
    - We need a bridge connecting the market directly to Rivermere's main road.
    - Both taxis and heavier delivery vehicles should be able to cross safely.
    - <b><#E09500>Make sure your design can handle them from one end of the bridge
      to the other</color></b>.
    - I'm counting on you, {PlayerName}! If you're ready, I've got the contract.
  continueOfferDialogue:
    name: Brooks
    sentences: []
  reminderDialogue:
    name: Brooks
    sentences:
    - <b><#E09500>Watch how the bridge responds as each vehicle moves across. We
      want everyone to reach the other side safely</color></b>.
  finishedContractDialogue:
    name: Brooks
    sentences:
    - Oh, this is wonderful!
    - Customers and delivery vehicles finally have a more direct way into the market.
    - The merchants are going to love this. Thank you so much, {PlayerName}!
